 ('civil','Civil','Three waters, earthworks, stormwater, flood and on-site wastewater design for residential and development sites. Choose a service below to see what is included and how we approach it.'),
 ('planning','Planning','Feasibility, subdivision and consent assessments for land development. We work out what your site can become, then guide it through the planning steps with council.'),
 ('survey','Survey','Topographic, title and boundary survey work. Accurate site information is the base for good design, so we start from the ground and work up.'),
 ('traffic','Traffic','Traffic reports and plan change assessments. We assess how a development affects the roads around it and prepare what council needs to see.'),
 ('construction','Construction',''),
 ('project-management','Project Management','Design, consent and construction coordinated with one accountable team. One point of contact keeps every consultant, council step and deadline moving together.'),
 ('neighbour-consent','Neighbour\u2019s Consent',''),
 ('cross-lease-to-freehold','Cross lease to freehold conversion','Gain full ownership and add value to your property with a freehold title, wherever feasible.'),
